@title Welcome to Customer Success
@subtitle Larkspur Software, November 2026 cohort
@author Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success

Welcome to Larkspur, and welcome to Customer Success. We are glad you are here.

Our team has 42 people across Denver, Dublin and Singapore. We support customers through every stage of their relationship with us, and we care a great deal about doing that well. You will be working alongside people who have seen a lot, and who are happy to share what they know.

# Your first week

- Monday: laptop pickup at 09:00, then a welcome breakfast.
- Tuesday: product deep dive with the Solutions team.
- Wednesday: shadow two customer calls.
- Thursday: support tooling training.
- Friday: lunch with your onboarding buddy.

# Your first 90 days

**By day 30**, you will learn the product well enough to explain it to a customer. Spend your time with your buddy, asking questions and reading the account notes.

**By day 60**, you will own five accounts alongside your buddy. You will take the first calls yourself, and your buddy will review your notes afterward.

**By day 90**, you will run quarterly business reviews on your own. By then you will have the context to know which conversations matter most, and you will be trusted to lead them.

# People to know

- Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success
- Owen Achterberg, Head of Support
- Priyanka Rao, Enablement lead

! Tip: the #cs-newbies channel is the best place to ask anything, and no question is too small.

Welcome again. I look forward to meeting you.

Nadia Farouk
VP of Customer Success
